  "metadata": {
    "title": "Mia GLM5.3 EXL3 DFlash2 runtime with verified home-lab f0 fabric bindings",
    "description": "Digest-pinned ARM64 vLLM image and Controller-native mp wrapper for MiaAI-Lab's 493cb88f GLM 5.3 Flash EXL3/TR3 plus DFlash2 K7 two-Spark profile. The consumed Dockerfile and overlays are byte-identical to the prior source pin; the newer source adds fail-closed numeric launch validation and a cold-prefill harness, while the Controller wrapper already fixes and validates those numeric knobs without SSH. Local adapter selects the observed active f0 primary rail and GID3 on both Sparks; the original f1 interfaces are down here. Local GPU execution remains unqualified.",
